# vss — Vintage Story modding reference

A lookup skill over the **game-understanding base** built by `vss-codex`. It tells you *where to look*
and *how to read it* — it never edits anything.

> **Reference root:** `{{REFERENCE_PATH}}`
> Every `docs/…` and `decompiled/…` path below (and in the reference files) is relative to this folder.

> Built from VS **{{VS_VERSION}}** ({{GENERATED_ON}}) by `vss-codex` — {{API_TYPES}} API types in
> {{API_NAMESPACES}} namespaces ({{COVERAGE_PCT}}% documented), {{EVENTS}} events, {{ENUMS}} enums,
> {{LIB_TYPES}} engine types. Rebuild with `vss-codex` after a VS update.

> **Local & gitignored.** This reference is derived from proprietary game binaries — never commit or
> share it. It is pinned to the VS build it was generated from; re-run `vss-codex` to refresh it.

